# Commits that only reformat: no behaviour change, no review value, and every
# line they touch is attributed to them by `git blame` unless it is told to
# skip them.
#
# Enable it once, locally:
#
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitLab's blame view honours this file on its own.
#
# Only add a commit here that a formatter produced in full. A commit mixing a
# reformat with a real change does not belong in this file, and does not belong
# in the history either -- split it.

